{"ID":"20240515131421-amwjyi5","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515131421-amwjyi5","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515131421-amwjyi5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515140013-k00m63l\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515140013-k00m63l\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:300,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515140013-k00m63l\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:550,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:637\u0026#125;","title":"049","type":"doc","updated":"20240515160044"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515140013-k00m63l","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 966px;","id":"20240515140013-k00m63l","updated":"20240515160044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/08/27"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"HJ"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"男"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"30歲"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/08/27"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"從高中到現在早晨起床精神都極差，如同沒睡般，白日極度想睡，近一年來連晚間也失眠。來診時已是白日極度想睡，而晚上完全不能睡的狀態。問診時表現焦慮，難以集中，有點語無倫次。已吃了好一陣子的安眠藥和抗焦慮藥。但白天仍然極度想睡，甚至開車開到一半也會睡著。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（1）胃口：不好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）大便：二天到四天一次(服HT68號養肝丸後較好)。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（3）睡眠：晚間不能眠，白日極想睡。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（4）手足：皆冷。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（5）頭痛：已無。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（6）寒熱：身無寒熱。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（7）口渴：不口渴，會忘記喝水。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（8）飲食：時常一天只吃一餐，會忘記吃飯。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（9）出汗：易出汗。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（10）其他：表現焦慮。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈浮數中空"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白紅乾"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"耳診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"無"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"裏寒實，造成陽不入陰。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"針灸處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"無"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中藥處方： "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生附子二錢、乾薑二錢、炙甘草三錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白术三錢、茯苓三錢、澤瀉五錢、桂枝三錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮附子三錢、細辛二錢、大黃三錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"龍骨三錢、牡蠣五錢、半夏三錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五付，"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"九碗煮成三碗，"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚餐前各一碗。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白天想睡是陰外出，晚上睡不著是陽外出，這與正常人剛好相反，師曰此是裏寒實，陽不能入陰導致晚上不能睡，白天反而陰氣外出，故欲寐。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"四逆湯除裏寒，大黃附子細辛湯除下焦寒實。龍骨牡蠣鎮定心神。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(請問老師：何以方中用五苓散架構卻去豬苓？方中半夏未知何義？是取靈樞中半夏秫米湯中用半夏之意嗎？倪師答：一般病人小便已多即去豬苓不用；沒錯，此乃取半夏秫米湯治無胃口的失眠。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]}]}